rtyName}'] is not the property of any @httpLabel member.\", ex.Message);","     }","+","+    // EC2-only hooks; the fixture's PutValue, AttributeValue, SpotSpec and Spec copy EC2's shapes.","+","+    [Fact]","+    public void SuppressResultGeneration_DropsTheOutput()","+    {","+        var customizations = new CustomizationsModel();","+        customizations.SuppressResultGeneration.Add(\"ListBuckets\");","+","+        var model = Apply(customizations);","+","+        Assert.Equal(ShapeId.Unit, Assert.IsType<OperationShape>(model.Shapes[\"com.example#ListBuckets\"]).Output);","+    }","+","+    // ec2's BlobAttributeValue.Value targets Blob, which is itself substituted, so the value's type resolves through it.","+    [Theory]","+    [InlineData(true)]","+    [InlineData(false)]","+    public void UnwrappedValue_WhoseTypeIsSubstituted_AppliesInEitherOrder(bool valueTypeFirst)","+    {","+        var customizations = new CustomizationsModel();","+        var valueType = new ShapeSubstitution { EmitAsShape = \"Text\" };","+        if (valueTypeFirst)","+        {","+            customizations.ShapeSubstitutions[\"LegacyId\"] = valueType;","+        }","+        customizations.ShapeSubstitutions[\"IdValue\"] = new ShapeSubstitution { EmitAsShape = \"Text\", EmitFromMember = \"Value\" };","+        if (!valueTypeFirst)","+        {","+            customizations.ShapeSubstitutions[\"LegacyId\"] = valueType;","+        }","+","+        var model = Apply(customizations);","+","+        var wrapper = Assert.IsType<StructureShape>(model.Shapes[\"com.example#IdValue\"]);","+        Assert.Equal(\"com.example#Text\", wrapper.Members[\"Value\"].Target.AbsoluteName);","+    }","+","+    // The old name sets the new shape's request-only keys with the same values, so they merge.","+    [Fact]","+    public void SubstitutedShape_OldNameMirroringTheNewShape_Merges()","+    {","+        var customizations = new CustomizationsModel();","+        var spec = TestCustomizations.Inject(\"Names\", new PropertyInjector { Shape = \"NameList\", LocationName = \"group\" });","+        TestCustomizations.Modify(\"Kind\", new PropertyModifier { LocationName = \"type\" }, spec);","+        customizations.ShapeModifiers[\"Spec\"] = spec;","+        var spotSpec = TestCustomizations.Inject(\"Names\", new PropertyInjector { Shape = \"NameList\", LocationName = \"group\", CustomMarshall = true });","+        TestCustomizations.Modify(\"Kind\", new PropertyModifier { LocationName = \"type\" }, spotSpec);","+        customizations.ShapeModifiers[\"SpotSpec\"] = spotSpec;","+        customizations.ShapeSubstitutions[\"SpotSpec\"] = new ShapeSubstitution { EmitAsShape = \"Spec\" };","+","+        Apply(customizations);","+","+        Assert.True(customizations.CustomMarshall(\"Spec\", \"Names\"));","+    }","+","+    [Theory]","+    [InlineData(\"mixed\", \"mixes renameShape with emitAsShape\")]","+    [InlineData(\"memberWithoutEmitAsShape\", \"sets emitFromMember or listMemberSuffixExclusions, which need emitAsShape\")]","+    [InlineData(\"exclusionsWithoutMember\", \"lists listMemberSuffixExclusions without an emitFromMember\")]","+    [InlineData(\"staleExclusion\", \"listMemberSuffixExclusions['Bucket'] targets a 'structure' shape, not an operation\")]","+    [InlineData(\"missingValueMember\", \"emits from member 'Missing', which the shape does not have\")]","+    [InlineData(\"wrongValueType\", \"emits 'Boolean', but member 'Value' targets 'smithy.api#String'\")]","+    [InlineData(\"operationInput\", \"substitutes the input or output of 'com.example#PutValue'\")]","+    [InlineData(\"unwrappedOperationInput\", \"substitutes the input or output of 'com.example#PutValue'\")]","+    [InlineData(\"unwrappedMapValue\", \"substitutes a key or value of map 'com.example#NameValueMap'\")]","+    [InlineData(\"sentByRequest\", \"which a request already sends\")]","+    [InlineData(\"oldNameRename\", \"changes the emitted 'Spec' class\")]","+    [InlineData(\"oldNameInject\", \"does not inject as 'IdList'\")]","+    [InlineData(\"newNameOnly\", \"sets an inject, locationName or customMarshall on 'Groups' that shapeModifiers['SpotSpec'] does not mirror\")]","+    [InlineData(\"differentLocationName\", \"sets an inject, locationName or customMarshall on 'Groups' that shapeModifiers['SpotSpec'] does not mirror\")]","+    [InlineData(\"injectNotSkipped\", \"sets an inject, locationName or customMarshall on 'Groups' that shapeModifiers['SpotSpec'] does not mirror\")]","+    [InlineData(\"substitutedAwayOverride\", \"marshallNameOverrides does not match any shape\")]","+    [InlineData(\"injectTaken\", \"injects 'Kind', which the shape already has\")]","+    [InlineData(\"accessModifier\", \"only 'internal' is supported\")]","+    [InlineData(\"marshallNameOverride\", \"'PutValueRequest.Missing', which is not a property of the shape\")]","+    [InlineData(\"suppressWrapped\", \"suppresses an output that operationModifiers wraps\")]","+    public void Ec2Hooks_Invalid_Throws(string invalid, string expectedInMessage)","+    {","+        var customizations = new CustomizationsModel();","+        var overrides = new Dictionary<string, Dictionary<string, MarshallNameOverride>>();","+        var names = new Dictionary<string, MarshallNameOverride>();","+        switch (invalid)","+        {","+            case \"mixed\":","+                customizations.ShapeSubstitutions[\"Bucket\"] = new ShapeSubstitution { RenamedShapeName = \"Bin\", EmitAsShape = \"String\" };","+                break;","+            case \"memberWithoutEmitAsShape\":","+                customizations.ShapeSubstitutions[\"AttributeValue\"] = new ShapeSubstitution { EmitFromMember = \"Value\" };","+                break;","+            case \"exclusionsWithoutMember\":","+                customizations.ShapeSubstitutions[\"SpotSpec\"] = new ShapeSubstitution { EmitAsShape = \"Spec\", ListMemberSuffixExclusions = [\"PutValue\"] };","+                break;","+            case \"staleExclusion\":","+                customizations.ShapeSubstitutions[\"AttributeValue\"] = new ShapeSubstitution { EmitAsShape = \"String\", EmitFromMember = \"Value\", ListMemberSuffixExclusions = [\"Bucket\"] };","+                break;","+            case \"missingValueMember\":","+                customizations.ShapeSubstitutions[\"AttributeValue\"] = new ShapeSubstitution { EmitAsShape = \"String\", EmitFromMember = \"Missing\" };","+                break;","+            case \"wrongValueType\":","+                customizations.ShapeSubstitutions[\"AttributeValue\"] = new ShapeSubstitution { EmitAsShape = \"Boolean\", EmitFromMember = \"Value\" };","+                break;","+            case \"operationInput\":","+                customizations.ShapeSubstitutions[\"PutValueRequest\"] = new ShapeSubstitution { EmitAsShape = \"Spec\" };","+                break;","+            case \"unwrappedOperationInput\":","+                customizations.ShapeSubstitutions[\"PutValueRequest\"] = new ShapeSubstitution { EmitAsShape = \"AttributeValue\", EmitFromMember = \"value\" };","+                break;","+            case \"unwrappedMapValue\":","+                customizations.ShapeSubstitutions[\"NameValue\"] = new ShapeSubstitution { EmitAsShape = \"Text\", EmitFromMember = \"Value\" };","+                break;","+            case \"sentByRequest\":","+                customizations.ShapeSubstitutions[\"SpotSpec\"] = new ShapeSubstitution { EmitAsShape = \"AttributeValue\" };","+                customizations.ShapeModifiers[\"SpotSpec\"] = TestCustomizations.Modify(\"Value\", new PropertyModifier { CustomMarshall = true });","+                break;","+            case \"oldNameRename\":","+                customizations.ShapeSubstitutions[\"SpotSpec\"] = new ShapeSubstitution { EmitAsShape = \"Spec\" };","+                customizations.ShapeModifiers[\"SpotSpec\"] = TestCustomizations.RenameMember(\"Kind\", \"Type\");","+                break;","+  